  m_text: 'In this experiment, you will interact with a virtual soft silicone ball.



    For
    each trial, perform the same movement:

    place your left palm under the ball,
    press gently, then add your thumb to increase the pressure.



    After each
    interaction, rate how clearly you perceived the ball deformation.



    Try
    to repeat the movement in the same way across all trials.'
